#: src/main.ui:75
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Picha za uso wako ambazo Ubuntu Hello zinalinganishwa dhidi yake. Weka "
"angalau mbili, kumbukumbu katika taa tofauti."

#: src/main.ui:97
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Inaonyesha miundo iliyohifadhiwa ya:"

#: src/main.ui:137
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Glasses, a change of facial hair or "
"different lighting change how your face looks to the camera, so a single "
"model can fail (for example in the evening under lamps). Add a second model "
"with glasses on or off, your other look, or in different light to keep "
"unlocking reliable."
msgstr ""
"Modeli moja tu ya uso imesajiliwa. Miwani, mabadiliko ya ndevu au mwanga "
"tofauti hubadilisha jinsi kamera inavyoona uso wako, hivyo modeli moja "
"inaweza kushindwa (kwa mfano jioni chini ya taa). Ongeza modeli ya pili "
"ukiwa na miwani au bila, mwonekano wako mwingine, au katika mwanga tofauti "
"ili kufungua kuendelee kuwa kwa kuaminika."

#: src/main.ui:146
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Ongeza mfano wa pili"

