msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "Arifa"

#: src/main.ui:445
msgid ""
"A desktop notification shows while Ubuntu Hello looks for your face, then "
"reports the result. Failed attempts stay in the notification list."
msgstr ""
"Arifa ya eneo-kazi huonyesha wakati Ubuntu Hello inatafuta uso wako, kisha "
"inaripoti matokeo. Majaribio yaliyoshindikana yabaki kwenye orodha ya arifa."

#: src/main.ui:476
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Onyesha arifa"

#: src/main.ui:482
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the result."
msgstr ""
"Kadi moja kwa kila jaribio la uthibitishaji wa uso, imesasishwa mahali pake "
"na tokeo."

#: src/main.ui:513
msgid "Notification sounds"
msgstr "Sauti za arifa"

#: src/main.ui:519
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr "Cheza sauti ya mfumo kwa jaribio linalotambuliwa au lisilofanikiwa."

#: src/main.ui:550
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Jumuisha uchunguzi"

#: src/main.ui:556
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to each "
"card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Ongeza muundo, uhakika dhidi ya kizingiti, fremu, kamera na muda kwa kila "
"kadi. Inafaa wakati wa kuripoti tatizo."

#: src/main.ui:618 src/main.ui:734
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Usalama"

#: src/main.ui:633
msgid ""
"How closely your face has to match, and whether Ubuntu Hello asks you to "
"confirm that you are really there."
msgstr ""
"Kiwango cha ulinganifu unaohitajika kwa uso wako, na kama Ubuntu Hello "
"itakuomba uthibitishe kuwa upo kweli mbele ya kamera."

#: src/main.ui:657
msgid "Face match strictness"
msgstr "Ukali wa ulinganifu wa uso"

#: src/main.ui:665 src/onboarding.ui:151
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Haraka"

#: src/main.ui:672 src/onboarding.ui:182
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Imesawazishwa"

#: src/main.ui:680 src/onboarding.ui:213
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Salama"

#: src/main.ui:702 src/onboarding.ui:250
msgid "Ask me to nod to confirm"
msgstr "Niombe nitikise kichwa ili kuthibitisha"

#: src/main.ui:708 src/onboarding.ui:259
msgid ""
"After your face matches, a notification asks you to nod. A photo held up to "
"the camera cannot nod."
msgstr ""
"Uso wako ukilingana, arifa itakuomba utikise kichwa. Picha iliyoshikiliwa "
"mbele ya kamera haiwezi kutikisa kichwa."

#: src/main.ui:771 src/onboarding.ui:759
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Uwekaji ufunguo / KWallet Fungua Kiotomatiki"

#: src/main.ui:786
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Washa uthibitishaji wa uso ili kufungua kiotomatiki ufunguo wako wa kuingia "
"au KWallet unapoingia. Hii huhifadhi nenosiri lako lililofungwa katika TPM "
"linapopatikana, au limesimbwa kwa njia fiche kwa AES-256-GCM kwa kutumia "
"ufunguo mkuu wa root pekee. Seti za uthibitishaji wa uso PAM_AUTHTOK kwa "
"pam_gnome_keyring au pam_kwallet5 kulingana na eneo-kazi lako."

#: src/main.ui:814
msgid "Current Status:"
msgstr "Hali ya Sasa:"

#: src/main.ui:823
msgid "Checking..."
msgstr "Inaangalia..."

#: src/main.ui:834
msgid "Enable Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Washa Kufungua Kiotomatiki"

#: src/main.ui:862
msgid "Keyring"
msgstr "Kuweka ufunguo"

#: src/main.ui:898
